§§ `s 836 justification by reference to accounts`

-- 836(1)(a): profits, losses, assets and liabilities
#ASSERT `s 836(1) whether a distribution may be made is determined by reference to the item as stated in the relevant accounts` `s 836(1)(a) profits, losses, assets and liabilities` `s 831(3)(a) Companies Act accounts` NOTHING EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- 836(1)(b)(i): Companies Act accounts, a provision of a kind specified under s 396
#ASSERT `s 836(1) whether a distribution may be made is determined by reference to the item as stated in the relevant accounts` `s 836(1)(b) provisions` `s 831(3)(a) Companies Act accounts` ((JUST TRUE)) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- 836(1)(b)(i): not of a specified kind: not covered
#ASSERT `s 836(1) whether a distribution may be made is determined by reference to the item as stated in the relevant accounts` `s 836(1)(b) provisions` `s 831(3)(a) Companies Act accounts` ((JUST FALSE)) EQUALS NOTHING
-- 836(1)(b)(i): s 396 unknown
#ASSERT `s 836(1) whether a distribution may be made is determined by reference to the item as stated in the relevant accounts` `s 836(1)(b) provisions` `s 831(3)(a) Companies Act accounts` NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING
-- 836(1)(b)(ii): IAS accounts, provisions of any kind
#ASSERT `s 836(1) whether a distribution may be made is determined by reference to the item as stated in the relevant accounts` `s 836(1)(b) provisions` `s 831(3)(b) IAS accounts` NOTHING EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- 836(1)(b): accounts of another kind: not mentioned
#ASSERT `s 836(1) whether a distribution may be made is determined by reference to the item as stated in the relevant accounts` `s 836(1)(b) provisions` `s 831(3) accounts of another kind` NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING
-- 836(1)(c): share capital and reserves
#ASSERT `s 836(1) whether a distribution may be made is determined by reference to the item as stated in the relevant accounts` `s 836(1)(c) share capital and reserves (including undistributable reserves)` `s 831(3)(b) IAS accounts` NOTHING EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- 836(1): another item: the list does not say "only"
#ASSERT `s 836(1) whether a distribution may be made is determined by reference to the item as stated in the relevant accounts` `s 836(1) another item` `s 831(3)(a) Companies Act accounts` NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING
-- 836(2)(a): would contravene by the last annual accounts
#ASSERT `s 836(2)(a) the distribution may be justified by reference to interim accounts` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- 836(2)(a): "where" fails
#ASSERT `s 836(2)(a) the distribution may be justified by reference to interim accounts` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- 836(2)(b): during the first accounting reference period
#ASSERT `s 836(2)(b) the distribution may be justified by reference to initial accounts` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- 836(2)(b): before any accounts have been circulated
#ASSERT `s 836(2)(b) the distribution may be justified by reference to initial accounts` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- 836(2)(b): "where" fails
#ASSERT `s 836(2)(b) the distribution may be justified by reference to initial accounts` FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- 836(2): neither exception applies
#ASSERT `s 836(2) the relevant accounts are the company's last annual accounts` FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- 836(2): interim accounts may be used: not decided
#ASSERT `s 836(2) the relevant accounts are the company's last annual accounts` TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- 836(2): initial accounts may be used: not decided
#ASSERT `s 836(2) the relevant accounts are the company's last annual accounts` FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- 836(3): section 837 as regards the last annual accounts
#ASSERT `s 836(3) the section whose requirements must be complied with as regards the accounts` `s 836(2) the company's last annual accounts` EQUALS `s 836(3) section 837 (last annual accounts)`
-- 836(3): section 838 as regards interim accounts
#ASSERT `s 836(3) the section whose requirements must be complied with as regards the accounts` `s 836(2)(a) interim accounts` EQUALS `s 836(3) section 838 (interim accounts)`
-- 836(3): section 839 as regards initial accounts
#ASSERT `s 836(3) the section whose requirements must be complied with as regards the accounts` `s 836(2)(b) initial accounts` EQUALS `s 836(3) section 839 (initial accounts)`
-- 836(4)
#ASSERT `s 836(4) the accounts may not be relied on for the purposes of this Part and the distribution is treated as contravening this Part` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- 836(4): "If any applicable requirement ... is not complied with"
#ASSERT `s 836(4) the accounts may not be relied on for the purposes of this Part and the distribution is treated as contravening this Part` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE

